# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository regardless of the
# platform doing the checkout or commit -- this project is built and
# tested on Linux, macOS, and Windows (see .github/workflows), and without
# this, Windows checkouts convert LF to CRLF on the fly, which is harmless
# for Go source (gofmt/go build don't care) but was producing a
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF" warning on every single commit from a
# Windows working copy.
* text=auto eol=lf
